es":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369567754","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111231#issuecomment-3369567754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111231","id":3369567754,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7I14YK","user":{"login":"ThePuzzlemaker","id":12666617,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjY2NjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12666617?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker","html_url":"https://github.com/ThePuzzlemaker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-06T00:31:29Z","updated_at":"2025-10-06T00:31:29Z","body":"@CreatedBySeb No, this did not work in Godot 4.4 either.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369567754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4761177091","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111231#issuecomment-4761177091","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111231","id":4761177091,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG8nMAw","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T06:52:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T06:52:48Z","body":"> I will also add that the official SDL [`testcontroller.c`](https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/blob/main/test/testcontroller.c) test works perfectly fine with this device and detects the proper axes, even in the very slightly outdated version of SDL in 06827c9 so the issue is not on SDL's behalf. Additionally, looking in a debugger, the axis events *are* detected for the yaw axis (one of the unmapped, non-functional axes) as an `SDL_EVENT_JOYSTICK_AXIS_MOTION` event but _not_ as an `SDL_EVENT_GAMEPAD_AXIS_MOTION` event.\n\nI decided to revisit this issue, and if that's the case, then there must be a faulty mapping for this device in the SDLGameControllerDB that we should most likely remove.\nIn which case we might not need to add new methods to make the joypads \"raw\" (i.e. ignore their mappings).\nI will try to fix this issue soon.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4761177091/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763079062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111231#issuecomment-4763079062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111231","id":4763079062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-bRlg","user":{"login":"ThePuzzlemaker","id":12666617,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjY2NjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12666617?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker","html_url":"https://github.com/ThePuzzlemaker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePuzzlemaker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T19:38:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T19:39:09Z","body":"@Nintorch I don't believe that is the case. There are still use-cases for ignoring mappings, as the gamepad mapping necessarily loses information about joysticks that have more buttons/axes than a traditional gamepad. This is useful for games like space simulators.\n\nI will update my PR with review soon when I have a bit more time and energy to do so.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763079062/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]